<h1>Contact us</h1>
<p>Found a mistake in a review, want a tool tested, or just have a question? Email us. A real person reads it.</p>
</div></section>

<section class="section"><div class="wrap">
<div class="prose">

<div class="contact-card">
<p class="contact-label">Email us directly</p>
<p class="contact-mail"><a class="mail-big" href="mailto:{{MAIL_OBF}}">{{MAIL_OBF}}</a></p>
<p class="contact-note">We read every message. Most get a reply within 2 business days.</p>
</div>

<h2>What to write to us about</h2>

<h3>Something in a review is wrong</h3>
<p>This is the one we care most about. If a price is stale, a feature has moved, or we got a fact wrong, tell us and we will check it and correct the page. Being accurate is the entire point of this site, so corrections jump the queue.</p>

<h3>Ask us to test a tool</h3>
<p>Using something we have not covered? Send the name and what you use it for. We cannot promise a full review, but requests with real detail get taken seriously.</p>

<h3>Business, partnerships, or sponsorship</h3>
<p>Say what you have in mind. We will tell you straight whether it is a fit. Paid placements do not change our verdicts, and we do not write positive reviews in exchange for money, so please do not ask.</p>

<h3>Anything else</h3>
<p>A question about how we test, a suggestion, or something you think we are missing. All of it is welcome.</p>

<h2>What to include</h2>
<ul>
<li>The name of the tool, if your message is about one.</li>
<li>What you were trying to do, and what actually happened.</li>
<li>A link to the page, if you are correcting something we published.</li>
</ul>
<p>The more specific you are, the faster we can help.</p>

<h2>What we cannot help with</h2>
<p>We do not run the tools we review, so we cannot reset your password, refund your subscription, or fix a bug you hit. For anything about billing, accounts, or technical faults, contact that tool's own support team. They can help; we cannot.</p>

<h2>Privacy</h2>
<p>Your email address is used to reply to you and nothing else. We do not add you to a list, and we do not pass it on. Details are in our <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

</div></div></section>

